{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のNHKのRの法則生放送見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山笑ったし\nめっちゃ早く時間がたつように感じました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今話題の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トレンディエンジェルさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永野さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハリウッドザコシショウさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムマシーン３号さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘンダーソンさん\n審査員には"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菊地亜美さんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中川家さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもスタジオが賑わい笑ってばかりの現場でした〜٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永野さんの真似を友達とやったりしてたし、\nよく学校でも「さいとうさんだぞ」って言ってたりしたので共演できて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘンダーソンさんの石焼イモのネタ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと初めて聞いたのですが\nメッッッチャ楽しいネタでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハリウッドザコシショウさんのお腹も可愛かったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムマシーン３号さんのなんでも太らせてしまうネタは最高でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで沢山笑った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前の東京ビッグサイトでの個別握手会！！！\n来てくださった方ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服装はノギビンゴの妄想予選で着た服を着たよ〜٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部では左下の髪型をはじめてやった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つのがはえちゃったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プンプンッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ台湾や香港から来てくださったり、\n熊本県からもきてくださったり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ広島から来たよーとか！色んなところから来てくださって嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人を大切に、きっと乃木坂をやっていなかったら出会ってなかったんだなと思うとなんだかとてもあったかい気持ちになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日伊織とGREEN GORA voI.3の取材をしてきましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても可愛いゴルフの服を着て和気藹々と楽しい現場でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかオシャレな感じで風を沢山浴びながらとったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月16日発売です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てね〜٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"°"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちかっ！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中みてくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにまた！キック披露しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日村さん！キックしちゃってごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして前回のブログタイトルの\n今日はマカオで日村さんが\nってなってたのですが、何故かタイトル途中まで記入してアップしてしまいまして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は\n今日はマカオで日村さんが買ってくれたブレスレットつけてるよー(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)\nって書く予定でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地震大丈夫でしたか？凄く揺れたからこわくてびっくりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755で心配してくれてありがとう☘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは少しだけどリュックに避難道具を入れてる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか地震がくるとドア開けれなくなって出れなくなっちゃうかもしれないからドアあけたほうがいいってことを知らなくて友達から聞いてはじめて知りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなわりと知ってるのかな？\n知らない人いたらみんなやってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではテストも近いので勉強してきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/05/17/7648784/0023.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}